description: "Organizes Life & Annuity offerings into enterprise lines of business for product governance, reporting, and navigation."
documentation: "Organizes Life & Annuity offerings into enterprise lines of business for product governance, reporting, and navigation."
historizeGolden: true
historizeMaster: false
enableDelete: true
attributes:
  - _type: EntityAttribute
